// F15: union(fillet = …) of sweep (circle d 6) and sphere d 9 at the path end fails for every
// radius (also 0.6); with sphere d 10 it works. Fragile, without a visible geometric reason.
// Status (report 13): open – rounding sweep/sphere (SMLib).
// EXPECT: error-free
union(fillet = 1) {
    sweep(path = [[0, 0, 0], [0, -13, -1], [0, -22, 4], [0, -23, 10]]) circle(d = 6);
    translate([0, -23, 10]) sphere(d = 9);
}
